    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hayo the Fox and the Little Emporium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/d2479943bbe0b67d851db0619995ad3d.avif?t=1747999508\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner has gone treasure hunting, leaving Hayo the fox behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hayo successfully run the emporium alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an item related to a customer is placed nearby, you can earn extra gold and trigger various effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Ready to Open</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your small 5x4 emporium (20 tiles), remove unnecessary items and arrange everything carefully so that customers and items are placed well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Emporium</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the business starts, items will be displayed and customers will enter the emporium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know where they'll appear...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they can find the items they want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Best Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After closing, you'll meet new customers and discover new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic choices to create your very own unique emporium!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time to Settle Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to settle accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check if you've achieved your profit goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not... your emporium will go bankrupt!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hayo the Fox and the Little Emporium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/d2479943bbe0b67d851db0619995ad3d.avif?t=1747999508\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner has gone treasure hunting, leaving Hayo the fox behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hayo successfully run the emporium alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an item related to a customer is placed nearby, you can earn extra gold and trigger various effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Ready to Open</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your small 5x4 emporium (20 tiles), remove unnecessary items and arrange everything carefully so that customers and items are placed well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Emporium</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the business starts, items will be displayed and customers will enter the emporium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know where they'll appear...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they can find the items they want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Best Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After closing, you'll meet new customers and discover new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make strategic choices to create your very own unique emporium!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time to Settle Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to settle accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check if you've achieved your profit goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not... your emporium will go bankrupt!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Deckbuilding roguelike. In Hayo and the Emporium, display the items your customers desire and earn as much gold as possible. Strategically manage your emporium to avoid bankruptcy!",
